      "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306452226005440?dgcid=rss_sd_all",
      "title": "Precision meets plasticity: engineering and neurobiological frontiers of low-intensity focused ultrasound neuromodulation",
      "content": "<p>Publication date: 15 October 2026</p><p><b>Source:</b> Neuroscience, Volume 614</p><p>Author(s): C. Azais, R. Espert, M.C. Montesinos, S. Khizroev, M. Pardo</p>",
